    {
      "text": "ye shall be proved, Gen. 42:15. prove them, whether they will walk in my law, Ex. 16:4. God is come to prove you, Ex. 20:20. God led thee … in the wilderness … to prove thee, Deut. 8:2. that he might prove thee, to do thee good, Deut. 8:16. God proveth you, to know whether ye love the Lord, Deut. 13:3. through them I may prove Israel, Judg. 2:22. David … had not proved it, 1 Sam. 17:39. queen of Sheba … came to prove him, 1 Kgs. 10:1 (2 Chr. 9:1). Examine me, O Lord, and prove me, Ps. 26:2. I proved thee at the waters of Meribah, Ps. 81:7. your fathers tempted me, proved me, Ps. 95:9 (Heb. 3:9). prove me … if I will not open you the windows of heaven, Mal. 3:10 (3 Ne. 24:10).",
